 </div>

 <el-drawer v-model="bomDrawer" title="编辑BOM产品" size="480px"><el-form label-position="top"><el-form-item label="产品"><el-input :model-value="bomDraft.productName" disabled/></el-form-item><el-form-item label="型号"><el-input v-model="bomDraft.model"/></el-form-item><div class="drawer-grid"><el-form-item label="数量"><el-input-number v-model="bomDraft.quantity" :min="1"/></el-form-item><el-form-item label="单位"><el-input v-model="bomDraft.unit"/></el-form-item></div><template v-if="can('PRICE_VIEW')"><el-form-item label="参考价"><el-input :model-value="money(bomDraft.referencePrice)" disabled/><small>来自产品中心，仅供参考</small></el-form-item><el-form-item label="项目单价"><el-input-number v-model="bomDraft.unitPrice" :min="0"/><small>仅影响当前项目，不修改产品中心参考价格</small></el-form-item></template><el-form-item label="用途"><el-input v-model="bomDraft.purpose"/></el-form-item><el-form-item label="备注"><el-input v-model="bomDraft.note" type="textarea" :rows="3"/></el-form-item></el-form><template #footer><el-button @click="bomDrawer=false">取消</el-button><el-button type="primary" @click="commitBomEdit">确认修改</el-button></template></el-drawer>
